{
 "_doc": "Road-marking decal atlases, keyed by texture name prefix (lower case; the longest matching prefix wins). lines: cells whose strips are paint lines running along axis (v: strips down the texture, u: across), used for exact line geometry. features: cells that are one marking each; dir is the texture axis pointing the way the marking faces (an arrow's head, the top of text read by an approaching driver, as -v when the text is upright in the texture), turn the axis an arrow's bend goes, through whether it also goes straight on. exclude: decals that aren't road paint (grime, chalk, skid marks, wall art).",
